---
// ContactCTA.astro
---

<section style="padding: 80px 0; background: #F5F5F7;">
  <div style="max-width: 1440px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 80px;">
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 24px;">

   

      <div style="padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F5F5F7; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Reparación</span>
        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Necesitas reparación?</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 auto 0; line-height: 1.7;">Diagnóstico gratuito en 30 minutos.</p>
        <a href="/servicio-tecnico-apple" style="background: #000; color: #fff; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px; margin-top: 20px; align-self: center;">
          <i class="bi bi-tools"></i> Agendar Cita
        </a>
      </div>

      <div style="padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; background: #F5F5F7; border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.05); transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Plan Retoma</span>
        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Vendes tu Apple?</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 auto 0; line-height: 1.7;">Cotiza en 2 minutos y recibe tu oferta inmediata.</p>
        <a href="/plan-retoma-apple" style="border: 1.5px solid #000; color: #000; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px; margin-top: 20px; align-self: center;">
          Cotizar ahora <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i>
        </a>
      </div>
    
      <div style="padding: 40px; border-radius: 20px; border: 1px solid #E5E5E5; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <span style="font-family: 'PT Mono', monospace; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #3A506B; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; display: block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Soporte</span>
        <h3 style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 1rem; margin: 0 0 12px 0; color: #000;">¿Dudas con la garantía?</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 1.05rem; color: #666; margin: 0 0 auto 0; line-height: 1.7;">Respuesta garantizada en máximo 2 horas.</p>
        <a href="https://wa.me/573124813094" target="_blank" style="border: 1.5px solid #000; color: #000; padding: 12px 24px; border-radius: 50px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.3s ease; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.3px; margin-top: 20px; align-self: center;">
          <i class="bi bi-whatsapp"></i> Chat de Soporte
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>  
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@700&family=PT+Mono&display=swap');
</style>
